<title>INDIA: India RBI says sets repos auction rate at 4.0 pct.</title>
<headline>India RBI says sets repos auction rate at 4.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Monday it set a cut-off rate of four percent at the repos auction held earlier in the day.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 42 bids for 13.25 billion rupees, of which it accepted 29 for 9.32 billion rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
